#. な～え～ぎ～？
msgctxt "0001 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Hey there, Ma~ko~to~!"
msgstr ""

#. なに、舞園とふたり？
#. デート？　デート？
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Ohh, is it just the two of you right now? Are you on a\n"
"da~~te?"
msgstr ""

#. え、ええっ！？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What!?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木ってばぁ、大人しい顔して手が早いんだぁ？
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Damn, Makoto! I never woulda guessed, but you're a\n"
"total player, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 違いますよ。
#. 私は苗木くんの助手なんです。
msgctxt "0005 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "No, no, it's nothing like that. I'm his assistant!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そ、そこまであっさり否定されると…
#. なんとなく…うぅ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To be dismissed just like that is somehow...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はぁ？　ジョシュ？
#. なにそれ？　新手のプレイ？
msgctxt "0007 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Huh? His assistant? What is that, like some new kinda\n"
"roleplay thing?"
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、あたしは
#. 人の趣味に口出さない主義なんでぇ～。
msgctxt "0008 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Well, whatever. What you're into is your business. I\n"
"don't judge!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃ、ごゆっくり！
msgctxt "0009 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Anyway, if you don't mind!"
msgstr ""

#. …………………
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …は、早く、
#. 体育館前ホールに行こうか！
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "L-Let's just head to the gym already!"
msgstr ""

#. はい、そうですね。
msgctxt "0012 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "Yeah, let's go."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、またいつモノクマが出てくるかと思うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't even wanna think about when he might show up\n"
"on that thing next...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はあ……
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな監視カメラ…壊してやりたいけど、
#. 壊したら、ボクも壊される…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I really wanna smash that camera. But if I break *it*\n"
"Monokuma will break *me*.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>無視するしかないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So I'll just have to try and ignore it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…なんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's this...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あ…！
#. もしかして、ハンドルをひねって景品を出す、アレ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh! Maybe if I turn the knob, a prize will come out!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>自販機だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A vending machine...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>一応、この辺は購買部らしいと言えるかな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess this must be the school store, then.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここ、購買部みたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yup, this is definitely the school store.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、和洋折衷というか…
#. 購買というより、古物商店っぽいな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But it has kind of a Japanese/Western blend. It seems\n"
"more like a cluttered antique store...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0024 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0025 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
